  - m_Id: 33259425353728
    m_Localized: How does password hashing work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33471447420928
    m_Localized: "Websites never store your password directly.\nInstead, they generate
      a hash\u2014a fixed string of characters.\n\nSame input \u2192 always the same
      hash\nOne letter difference \u2192 completely different hash  \nNo one can
      deduce the original password from the hash"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 33685524697088
    m_Localized: 'Your password:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34071308390400
    m_Localized: Create your SimVault account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34858214346752
    m_Localized: 'Important: Be sure to remember this master password!\nWithout this
      password, you will lose access to all your passwords.\nWrite it down and keep
      it in a safe place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35234682490880
