  - m_Id: 36879038402560
    m_Localized: Set up biometric security
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37077265403904
    m_Localized: Would you like to log in using your fingerprint or a PIN from now
      on? If so, click "Register biometrics\n \nThis is optional, but it provides
      extra security compared to just a password!
    m_Metadata:
